# Runtime authentication settings are documented in .dev.vars.example and FOODLANE.md.
# Local secrets go in ignored .dev.vars; production secrets go in Wrangler.
# Optional public Google Maps JavaScript API key (restrict by HTTP referrer and API).
# This browser key is visible to site visitors and must never be a private server key.
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-restricted-browser-key
